 McCormack","Tamsin Topolski","Adrian Rawlins","Alec Utgoff","Rade Šerbedžija","Branko Djurič","Sean Gilder","Colin Mace","James Anthony-Rose","Charlie Rowe","Eliot Salt","Gavin Spokes","Sion Daniel Young","Lucy Aarden","Max Bennett","Nick Blood","Sarah Daniela Seggari","Al Barclay","Thomas Coombes","Alexandra D'Sa","Rebecca Dyson-Smith","Selahattin Çakir","Fırat Doğruloğlu","Caroline Harker","Simon Chandler","Guy Robbins","Susan Fordham","Katie Lyons","Tom Bradby","Divian Ladwa","Zahari Baharov","Laura Bayston","Katherine Waterston","Hugo Weaving","Tom Mulheron","Rút Schmidtová","Lesley Harcourt","Joanna Scanlan","Michael Akinsulire","Will Austin","Farid Larbi","Tom Wozniczka","Kiran Sonia Sawar","Jessica Ellerby","Fred Bianconi","Eric Savin","Mikaël Fitoussi","Didier Brice","Coralie Audret","Turlough Convery","Khalid Laith","Robbie O'Neill","Russell Bentley","Leroy Kincaide","Anna Wilson-Jones","Chi Lewis-Parry","Isla Gie","Yerden Telemissov","Gsus Lopez","Nick Mohammed","Cherrelle Skeete","Abraham Popoola","Victoria Hamilton","Neil D'Souza","Edward Davis","Sophie Duval","Dallas Campbell","Colin Hoult","Krishnan Guru-Murthy","Jono Grant","Fady Elsayed","Sara Kestelman","Jennifer Aries","Bilal Hasna","Dan Mersh","Joe Barnes","Sean Cernow","Matt Green","Mike Sengelow","Nigel Pilkington","Lenny Rush","Lucian Msamati","Harry Lloyd","Kyle Soller","Daniel Fearn","Naomi Wirthner","Pierro Niel-Mee","Tom Hendryk"],"screenwriters":["Will Smith","Morwenna Banks","Mark Denton","Jonny Stockwood","Sean Gray"],"cinematographers":["Danny Cohen","David Chizallet"],"composers":["Daniel Pemberton","Toydrum"],"reviews":[{"author":"renton25","text":"Za mňa jedno z najlepších špionážnych diel, aké som kedy videl. Výborne napísané postavy, skvelé dialógy a suchý anglický humor mi sadol na sto percent. Gary Oldman je odpudivý, vulgárny, lenivý, cynický a zároveň absolútne brilantný. Jednoznačne odporúčam každému, kto hľadá niečo inteligentnejšie. Veľká spokojnosť.(19.04.2026)","stars":5},{"author":"dr.fish","text":"Nenechme se mást, že by dle místních hodnocení šlo o nějakou mimořádnou událost v dějinách seriálů. Ale na tu bídu co se dneska chrlí ze studií, je toto docela slušné a na Apple poměry dokonce velice slušné. Byly tu ovšem už daleko silnější kusy v minulosti. Gary Oldman to celé drží pevně nad vodou. Místy je to nudné, ale jinak poměrně koukatelné. Druhá série asi nejlepší. Celkově 75%(27.01.2025)","stars":4},{"author":"Heywood","text":"Chvílemi až lehce parodické, k MI5 kritické a Oldman je extratřída. Mimochodem položil si někdo otázku: Kolikátý je to film, kde \"vedoucí úlohu\" mají ženy a jsou v těch funkcí hloupém, otřesné, zákeřné, nesolidní a vůbec jinak záporné. Přestává to být skoro náhodné. Klaďaska v Moonfallu je naopak trapnost a výčet by mohl pokračovat. Já jen, že když se tak volá po těch kvótách... nějak to ti filmaři asi neslyší, a pokud ano, tak kriticky.(10.05.2022)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Apple TV","url":"https://srv.clickfuse.com/ads/adclkr.php?id=100006636&url=https%3A//tv.apple.com/cz/show/slow-horses/umc.cmc.2szz3fdt71tl1ulnbp8utgq5o"},{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/slow-horses/serie-1/epizoda-1/?utm_campaign=vod_content&utm_content=feed&utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=partner&utm_term="}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/987588-slow-horses/prehled/","csfd_id":987588,"root_id":987588,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":6,"episode_count":36,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2022-04-08","last_vod_date":"2025-10-29","episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2022-04-08","title":"Špatné špionážní praktiky (S01E03)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2022-04-15","title":"Návštěvní hodiny (S01E04)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2022-04-22","title":"Deba